Z||000000||Monkeyman||03-01-2000||06:30 PM||||I need some suggestions for some names for the new Monkeymobile.  Somehow, "DavesGT" just doesn't have the right ring to it!  I'd have a contest or something, but I don't have anything to give away.  How about this...Whoever's name I chose gets their name (in very small, almost legible print <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">) under the new name when it goes on the car.  (I don't know when this will happen.)<P>So far DRH has suggested:  Monkeymobile II, Son of Monkeymobile, and Monkeymobile 2000.<P>Any other suggestions?  There isn't any time limit, but I'll be getting the car in a little less than 250 hours so I'd like to come up with something before then.<P>TIAFASYMH||||reg||1
