Z||000035||frontal lobe||03-06-2000||12:04 AM||||Now I'm confused.  I haven't heard of monkey referred to as "chango".  Not that I exactly get to speak a lot of Spanish up here in Wisconsin and when I do, it's not exactly often that the word "monkey" enters the conversation!  I did look it up in a dictionary I have and it said "mono".  As far as naming the car, no one has come up with monkmobile for, I think, obvious reasons.  Too hard to get the hair just right and too hard to clutch in robe and sandals.||||reg||1
