Z||000038||Monkeyman||03-06-2000||05:29 AM||||Good ones, Steve.  Ummm...I'll think about those. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>frontal lobe--I can't remember who said it (and it could be wrong), but "chango" was posted on PFF a while ago.  I took 4 years of Spanish in HS (long ago) but can't remember much.  Went to a friends wedding a couple of weeks ago (she married a gentleman of Mexican decent).  Traditional Mexican wedding (I guess).  I got lost after the minister mentioned her name!  (For anyone who's seen a traditional Mexican wedding, what's up with the rope and pocket change?)<BR>Oops...Getting long winded.<BR>No probs with getting the hair right.  I just got it cut and it's an auto (Getrag is on my wish list. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">)<BR>||||reg||1
