Z||000041||Monkeyman||03-07-2000||08:37 PM||||Your name (?) is safe for now.  I'm called Monkeyman because my wife and I love monkeys (& apes & gorillas & orangutans & etc!).  We collect 'em.  So far we have well over 300.  My license plate says, "MNKY MAN" therefore my Fiero is the Monkeymobile.<P>There's only a few days left to submit your suggestions for the name of the new Monkeymobile.  I like alot of what I've read, but I want more to chose from.<P>106.5 hours to go!! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Almost there!!!||||reg||1
