Z||000043||Monkeyman||03-08-2000||05:12 AM||||Gokart--You'd call them stuffed, but we're very serious about our "babies".  We have them all over the living room, computer room, and upstairs mostly with a few others scattered about the house.  It's a good thing we don't live in an apartment!  If I can ever figure out a way to take a pic of them, I'll post it.||||reg||1
