Z||000052||Monkeyman||03-13-2000||10:17 PM||||CHADMAN!!<P>The purple paint did it.  I took a stick (didn't have a sword) and officially dubbed the GT...Grape Ape!  From now until forever (or until I decide I don't want the car anymore--both should happen about the same time!), my new '85 GT is the Grape Ape.<P>Chadman your name will appear under "Grape Ape" as soon as I decide where and how I want to put the name on the car.  (Did that make sense?)<P>BTW--Does anyone have a good (high res) pic of the actual Hanna-Barbera ape they can send me??||||reg||1
